  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The maximum frequency for reflection of sky waves<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is a maximum electron density.<br /><br /><b>For F<sub>2</sub> layer,</b></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>MHz</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>maximum electron density,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>·</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>11</mn></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mtext>m</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
